comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T08:33:38.852Z","harness:codex","GitHub sources: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/921 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/922. Duplicate check searched all 2,351 items and every status for clone-local/gitignored merge receipts,fresh-clone CI,discarded values,history-repair,and both GH numbers. The reports share one root contract and are intentionally consolidated; closed pm-ysqb6n is predecessor evidence,not an active duplicate."
  "2026-08-08T15:39:02.830Z","harness:codex","Investigation boundary (2026-08-08): this PR deliberately does not claim fresh-clone durability. The implemented receipt work classifies lossless versus discarded-value decisions and requires explicit acceptance, but raw recovery receipts remain clone-local and ignored. A durable privacy-safe pushed evidence design needs a separate tracked-record contract and fresh-clone lifecycle, so retaining this item as open avoids falsely closing GH-921/GH-922."
body: ""
